	(text "02 Two half-bridge synchronous bucks in triangular-current mode (TCM, zero-voltage turn-on on both edges; f 40-150 kHz, both bridges at one frequency, interleaved; STATUS fourth pass). IKP08N65F5 on the chassis plate, 220 pF snubbers, 220 / 470 uH, C1 = 100 uF + 4.7 uF film through the I_C shunt, second stage 68 uH / 4.7 uF film / 22 uF + 1.0 ohm leg. Sized for V_ANODE 0.7 A continuous / 0.8 A peaks, V_SCREEN 0.18 A (trips +-3.0 A). Outputs: V_ANODE (W04-a) and V_SCREEN (W05-a)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "762f1af3-5d1b-51ed-8374-4cfe964cb8b3")
	)
	(text "Bridge 1: V_ANODE 0-400 V, 0.7 A continuous (about 401 V at 420 V raw, D_max 0.97)"
